@step Preview the census facts the downloaded certificate carries.
@static aeat config profile censo import --file certificado-g313.pdf
@blocked operator-artifact Needs the operator's own G313 censo certificate PDF from the AEAT sede.
@step Record the certificate's facts onto the active profile.
@static aeat config profile censo import --file certificado-g313.pdf --apply
@blocked operator-artifact Needs the operator's own G313 censo certificate PDF from the AEAT sede.
